4,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1077,"speakerName":"クロリンデ","textMapHash":1159237674,"text":"千織やシャルロットはどうだ？彼女たちになら任せられると思う。","nextNodeIds":[140310105]},{"nodeId":140310105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":4264223354,"text":"聞いてみたんだけど、二人とも最近忙しくて、時間がないんだって。うちのメンバーたちには数日ゆっくり休んでって言ったばかりだから、みんなに声を掛けるのも気が引けて…","nextNodeIds":[140310106]},{"nodeId":140310106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1077,"speakerName":"クロリンデ","textMapHash":2428432178,"text":"…困ったな。","nextNodeIds":[140310107]},{"nodeId":140310107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2207224434,"text":"よう、ナヴィア！クロリンデ！","nextNodeIds":[140310108]},{"nodeId":140310108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":445725250,"text":"あら！相棒とパイモン！やっほー！","nextNodeIds":[140310109]},{"nodeId":140310109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1077,"speakerName":"クロリンデ","textMapHash":298265154,"text":"…ナヴィア！","nextNodeIds":[140310110]},{"nodeId":140310110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":160270314,"text":"…あっ！もしかして…！","nextNodeIds":[140310111]},{"nodeId":140310111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1077,"speakerName":"クロリンデ","textMapHash":1826863970,"text":"ああ、チャンスだ…","nextNodeIds":[140310112,140310113]},{"nodeId":140310112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3414748730,"text":"…な、何する気？","nextNodeIds":[140310114]},{"nodeId":140310114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3256281498,"text":"おまえら、なにか困ったことでもあったのか？","nextNodeIds":[140310115]},{"nodeId":140310115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":2554334682,"text":"そうなの。相棒！今…とんでもない難題を抱えてるんだけど、あんたたちにしか解決できないことなの！","nextNodeIds":[140310116]},{"nodeId":140310116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3666229474,"text":"大げさじゃないのか？","nextNodeIds":[140310117]},{"nodeId":140310117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1077,"speakerName":"クロリンデ","textMapHash":1848922202,"text":"いや、全然大げさじゃない…もうどうしようもないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[140310118,140310119]},{"nodeId":140310118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":974393186,"text":"一体どれほどの難題なの…","nextNodeIds":[140310120]},{"nodeId":140310120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":234826506,"text":"旅人、パイモン…","nextNodeIds":[140310121]},{"nodeId":140310121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":883530698,"text":"——『ファントムハンター：審判の時』を一緒に遊んでくれない！？","nextNodeIds":[140310122]},{"nodeId":140310122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4236244586,"text":"…なんだって？","nextNodeIds":[140310123]},{"nodeId":140310123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1077,"speakerName":"クロリンデ","textMapHash":1530380058,"text":"フォンテーヌの「テーブルトークシアター倶楽部」が出した、テーブルゲームのシナリオだ。","nextNodeIds":[140310124]},{"nodeId":140310124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":946144962,"text":"テーブルトークシアターゲームって聞いたことある？友達とテーブルを囲んで、キャラクターを演じながらシナリオを進めていくゲームなんだけど、あたし、小さい頃から大好きなの。","nextNodeIds":[140310125]},{"nodeId":140310125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1837185242,"text":"へえ、面白そうだな！","nextNodeIds":[140310126]},{"nodeId":140310126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":2006376754,"text":"あたしもクロリンデも昔からこの会のメンバーよ。で、最近メンバーが新しいシナリオを作ったから、試しに遊んでみてほしいって言ってきたの。","nextNodeIds":[140310127]},{"nodeId":140310127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":1605234754,"text":"だからこれは新しいシナリオなのよ！でもって、あたしたちが初めてのプレイヤーってわけ！","nextNodeIds":[140310128]},{"nodeId":140310128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1077,"speakerName":"クロリンデ","textMapHash":256814658,"text":"試遊段階のシナリオは普通、多くの問題点があるものなんだ。けど、今回のものは完成度が高いし、作者の考察も行き届いていて…なかなかよくできていると思う。","nextNodeIds":[140310129]},{"nodeId":140310129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":1306632986,"text":"ストップストップ！あたしはシナリオ読まずにあんたに渡したんだから、ネタバレしないで！","nextNodeIds":[140310130]},{"nodeId":140310130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1077,"speakerName":"クロリンデ","textMapHash":297690370,"text":"…とにかく、このシナリオには四人のプレイヤーが必要なんだけど、一人足りないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[140310131]},{"nodeId":140310131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2685663370,"text":"…本当にとんでもない難題だね！","nextNodeIds":[140310132]},{"nodeId":140310132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":557393754,"text":"あんたもそう思うでしょ？相棒。","nextNodeIds":[140310133]},{"nodeId":140310133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1598870354,"text":"でもオイラと旅人って二人だけど、いいのか？","nextNodeIds":[140310134]},{"nodeId":140310134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1077,"speakerName":"クロリンデ","textMapHash":3225899658,"text":"問題ない。プレイ体験を損なわないよう、実際の参加者数に応じて進行は調整する。","nextNodeIds":[140310135]},{"nodeId":140310135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2913255490,"text":"へへっ、どうする？遊んでみるか？おまえに任せるぜ。","nextNodeIds":[140310136,140310137]},{"nodeId":140310136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":755857394,"text":"友達が困ってるなら助けないと！","nextNodeIds":[140310138]},{"nodeId":140310138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1077,"speakerName":"クロリンデ","textMapHash":4237824914,"text":"よかった。これで問題解決だ。","nextNodeIds":[140310139]},{"nodeId":140310139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":2498665562,"text":"よし！じゃあ、さっそくシナリオ担当を呼んでくるよ！","nextNodeIds":[140310140]},{"nodeId":140310140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":213349026,"text":"シナリオ担当？シナリオってクロリンデが持ってるんじゃないのか？","nextNodeIds":[140310141]},{"nodeId":140310141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1077,"speakerName":"クロリンデ","textMapHash":2988881458,"text":"このシナリオに合わせ、倶楽部は新しい遊び方を考えた。","nextNodeIds":[140310142]},{"nodeId":140310142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1077,"speakerName":"クロリンデ","textMapHash":1111852754,"text":"最初、進行役である「ゲームマスター」が持っているシナリオは完全なものではない——初めのストーリーをクリアしてやっと、シナリオ担当から次の章のシナリオを受け取れるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[140310143]},{"nodeId":140310143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1077,"speakerName":"クロリンデ","textMapHash":2079974690,"text":"さらに、参加者に臨場感を与えるために、倶楽部はシナリオのシチュエーションを再現する。そして初日の集合場所は、シナリオ担当が教えてくれるまで分からないというわけだ。","nextNodeIds":[140310144]},{"nodeId":140310144,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2493705554,"text":"おお、シナリオの作者も、かなりこだわってるんだな！","nextNodeIds":[140310145]},{"nodeId":140310145,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":2530212962,"text":"へへっ、ワクワクしてきたでしょ？ゲームマスターですら、物語の結末を知らないんだもの！","nextNodeIds":[140310146]},{"nodeId":140310146,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1077,"speakerName":"クロリンデ","textMapHash":3404610074,"text":"あなたたちと一緒に結末を見届けられるのを楽しみにしている。","nextNodeIds":[140310147]},{"nodeId":140310147,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":29483826,"text":"他のみんなは千織屋で待ってるから、先に合流しておいて。あたしはあとでシナリオ担当と一緒に向かうよ。","nextNodeIds":[140310148]},{"nodeId":140310148,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1077,"speakerName":"クロリンデ","textMapHash":1246415586,"text":"ああ。焦らず、足元に気をつけてな。","nextNodeIds":[140310149]},{"nodeId":140310149,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":1980858482,"text":"もう、子ども扱いしないでってば。","nextNodeIds":[140310150]},{"nodeId":140310150,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1075,"speakerName":"ナヴィア","textMapHash":3896438378,"text":"うーん…そうね…今回はどんなキャラクターを演じようかしら？","nextNodeIds":[140310151]},{"nodeId":140310151,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1077,"speakerName":"クロリンデ","textMapHash":2650408218,"text":"…今回は普通の技能を習得してくれ。それと、動物を見かけるたびに「説得」しようとするのはやめてくれ…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":140310137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3784171434,"text":"いいシナリオがあるなら遊ばないと！","nextNodeIds":[140310138]},{"nodeId":140310119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2575645626,"text":"とりあえず聞かせて…","nextNodeIds":[140310120]},{"nodeId":140310113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3078523074,"text":"…た、ただの通りすがりだよ。","nextNodeIds":[140310114]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1403101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1077"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":1403102,"order":3,"stepDescription":"「千織屋」で他のメンバーと合流する","stepDescTextMapHash":326871060,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1403102,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1071"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[1403102],"talks":[{"talkId":1403102,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":f